  <History Date="31-03-11" Author="John Rogers" Comment="Updated Macros." />
  <History Date="19-10-11" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Removed PT Speed update from Control.  Removed shutter update from colour." />
  <History Date="19-10-11" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Increased wheel resolution.  Shortened names for Expert LCD.  Reordered shutter." />
  <History Date="19-10-11" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added missing macros.  Added pixel mapper compatibility." />
  <History Date="07-11-11" Author="John Rogers" Comment="Removed Virtual Dimmer from Cells." />
  <History Date="07-12-11" Author="John Rogers" Comment="Edited Colour Macro Zone Effects to Value range." />
